@startuml Code Diagram
title Диаграмма последовательности: Получение температуры

actor Пользователь
participant API_Gateway
participant Monitoring_Service
participant Temperature_API
participant Monitoring_DB

Пользователь -> API_Gateway: GET /temperature?location=LivingRoom
API_Gateway -> Monitoring_Service: Forward request
Monitoring_Service -> Temperature_API: HTTPS GET /temperature?location=LivingRoom
Temperature_API --> Monitoring_Service: JSON response with temperature
Monitoring_Service -> Monitoring_DB: Save telemetry data
Monitoring_Service --> API_Gateway: Return temperature data
API_Gateway --> Пользователь: JSON response

@enduml
